        "id": 28903,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-26T14:16:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Christopher&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Christopher\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Are you getting a plus 1 to all your damage, from Legacy, Ra, <span class=\"bbcode-b\">[redacted]</span>, or even maybe an Obsidian Field?<br>\n…<br>\nThoughts?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Exclusive! New hero is called [redacted]! Perhaps with the power to blank villain cards?</p>\n<p>Oh and of minor note they have a card that increases damage, meh</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>That’s a solid strategy and highlights a couple of things I had missed when playing her, thanks for the in depth overview</p>",
