        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-26T15:43:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fanatic is deceptive in that she seems like an immediate power character (two attacks every turn!), but in fact she is a slow-build character. You have to know in advance that the Aegis of Resurrection and Wrathful Retribution are out there so that it makes sense to get through your deck and use up your HPs.</p>",
