      {
        "id": 28911,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-27T01:37:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is also a fantastic and entirely valid Fanatic strategy.  Each hero has several different strategies they can employ.</p>\n<p>As for your awp832’s strategy being more conservative than mine… well, most people play more conservatively than I do.  Just ask anyone at the most recent batch of demos in Indianapolis (or really anyone who has played a game with me).  I am very “ALL CARDS DOWN” crazy-go-nuts player who usually goes after aggressive strategies and cares not for his own HP.</p>\n<p>Probably because this same strategy works in real life martial combat as well.  Just sayin’.</p>\n<p>Note: this does not mean this is the correct strategy for each character.  In fact, it is often the WRONG strategy.  It’s just how I like to play when I’m playing for fun.  <em>grin</em></p>",
